{"id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-compactness.md","title":"Compactness Theorem","display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-compactness","aliases":["17-thm-compactness"],"display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"source_section":"1.3; 2.1","source_result":"Theorem 1.3.22","source_pages_print":[33,67],"source_pages_djvu":[49,83],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-1.2.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3; 2.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 1.3.22"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span><span>67</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span><span>83</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.2.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T_0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T_0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is semantic compactness: satisfiability of every finite subtheory is equivalent to satisfiability of the whole theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-theory, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T_0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"abf539a1037d08d1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。\n$T_\\forall$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。\n证明使用 [[17-df-diagram]] 的图示及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。"},{"id":"41b33a3963b5c68a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4646e8fdeb7322ed","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"49c16a998c61a1e3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"67e164c877491dc2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"This is the same compactness implication as [[17-thm-compactness]], with the proof routed through a Henkin completion rather than an ultraproduct."},{"id":"d868412e4c7fb403","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。"},{"id":"421b1aea26ad8bcb","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本节点新增的是有限子理论模型族的具体超积实现；已有 [[17-thm-compactness]]、[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]] 是紧致性的不同接口，并不指定这些给定模型的超积。搜索本册的 ultraproduct、compactness、超积和紧致性以及现有 MOC 后未找到同一构造性接口。"},{"id":"2c69f6ba0ceba942","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-erdos-rado]]\n[[17-thm-existential-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-finite-ramsey]]\n[[17-thm-fraisse-limit]]\n[[17-thm-horn-axiomatization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-isomorphic-ultrapowers]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah-predicate-form]]\n[[17-thm-lindstrom]]\n[[17-thm-los]]\n[[17-thm-los-quotient-form]]\n[[17-thm-los-vaught]]\n[[17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski]]\n[[17-thm-model-companion-uniqueness]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-existential-test]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-formula-test]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-s